    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "support doesn't really help though. calling a hotline won't pay the rent or make the kids stop needing things from me every single second. it's not just being stressed, it's like... there is no \"me\" left to help. i'm just a machine that performs tasks until it breaks. i just want the noise to stop. i want everything to just be quiet for once.",
